<title>USA: UST shareholders approve Walden acquisition.</title>
<headline>UST shareholders approve Walden acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>UST Corp said its shareholders have approved the acquisition of Walden Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>The acquisition, which will be accounted for as a pooling of interests, involves the exchange of 1.9 shares of UST for each share of Walden Bancorp.</p>
<p>Shareholders also voted to increase the number of authorized shares of UST to 45,000,000 shares from 30,000,000 shares.  </p>
<p>It is expected that, subject to final regulatory approval, the acquisition will be consummated in January.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
